                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>On September 29 Dulles also met with Eden and the Acting New Zealand High
                    Commissioner to discuss the Chinese onshore islands. For a memorandum of their
                    conversation by Bowie, September 29, see the compilation on China in <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v14p1">volume XIV</ref>.</p>
            </div>
